`s 2(1) "product financing" the activity is product financing` MEANS
    IF `the activity meets the Second Schedule meaning of product financing`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "has the meaning given in the Second Schedule"

